#: scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aea9e6dccb5c6c96b942fa7d7834e64cf868ccfe583e44f2dd3aadd478f40eb
#. default-sha256: 48d63bfae41a74db9514d8845d9de1cf37b2ece081cead2ed95e4f783de5d8a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫His eyebrows were furrowed, creating deep creases on his "
"forehead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ses sourcils froncés formaient des plis profonds sur son "
"front."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d76500c5ad16ebff8506c17570b3d7143637ac7e65507e0e22f12201cfef67f8
#. default-sha256: 5b02a2bf47a75e7d5b3b7add7dea934b4444ad380c7e767f56eb90c648d43d5b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Plusieurs serviteurs s’écartèrent de sa route et regardèrent, les yeux ronds, leur maître "
"qui descendait le couloir d’un pas furieux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d73f0d59faafce9b75029ec848a2a1ac04ca0d832d6ddf58054e943b360513b3
#. default-sha256: 3ab26d30bb04e3943851bcaae2e9511ae1af237649338dfd5ee4bfc91394d9d6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, no one said a word to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pourtant, personne ne lui adressa la parole."

#: scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70b9415438d929552668ab0f49003ce50e180b7636801f4d2cd1ecc8dc5389e0
#. default-sha256: daf04e842a0e4891ca0c2397344d4fa0bbe59e811d25bd58ebdd3ad4df4cd429
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I not been preoccupied attending to his countryman..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si je n’avais pas été occupée à me charger de son compatriote..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b080b73776bd41d4b92a53277f40569f5f9c2b111902e4127810c1257fed1827
#. default-sha256: 7373a4c0744b1b997b9257830939bc196d852d5a84144c18868df66b9e824072
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...j’aurais peut-être pu l’empêcher. ⟪k:1⟫Rien qu’à voir son visage, on pouvait deviner que "
"quelque chose de terrible allait se produire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4593bb6c61a0ce29d63fde01b6a54f50e9c394fa8e088cf4a8ca66463c50d364
#. default-sha256: 8f53eb4901f3f75e1ad0c0e86ddd26ecf3092402cd3718e63ef1a6c11bbdbce6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Something that would serve only to further her misfortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quelque chose qui ne ferait qu’aggraver le malheur de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 122f4b54544d230388a479934d57dda68911501855e5a4b36bbac22bd29e2adb
#. default-sha256: 371523f7f6f4b7a78b55df9c1779033e3f928ec785453764a86045f41975cfed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was already in a less-than-ideal situation..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sa situation était déjà loin d’être idéale..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a072db7b4ce268bd794b2408e25fbe76ea589415ce020744d00d473a1acdc25c
#. default-sha256: 660c94ef77185b5bd1212b82d6773c6a084deda49a6d98d9a1842088ca50f544
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and it was perched on the edge of a hill, soon to begin rolling down into even worse "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...elle était perchée au sommet d’une falaise et s’apprêtait à rouler tout au fond du "
"précipice, dans un endroit encore pire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3
