msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Pardon...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pardon... ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33b33945d679ca5f00c0b44c03f1445d4ec024030364066409c970f6cf73d394
#. default-sha256: 5464ea07193ac0a5049a685052fa9c27d63cf2f40fe05a728687bd7f90d90a8e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Y a-t-il quelque chose que vous "
"voulez si désespérément me cacher que je doive ⟪k:12⟫toquer⟪k:13⟫ avant d’entrer ?! Que je doive "
"vous faire savoir à l’avance que je viens ?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7f453b4b033283f35ae41c6545be3296eabcd71a2d00e563f887ab11fef9414
#. default-sha256: 573b890cb715a769434d12007ed73ef9a8b4df5ca073ede89ec715201ad35035
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Qu-⟪k:1⟫Quoi— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫De quoi—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abe94d9217ea3aa26023b89317934cd68a2b188838329e99b7f068dff94bdea4
#. default-sha256: 022e348f6354811ee843dc917390120ec9ac128a1976148d20c5b41bdbe0cc58
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eh bien ?! ⟪k:1⟫Est-ce le cas ?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vous êtes allée ⟪k:5⟫le⟪k:6⟫ voir dans mon "
"dos, à ce que j’apprends !⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Que lui avez-vous dit ?! Vous vous êtes plainte à mon sujet ?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 007ad58f96cfbe6f5751458fba21feb86845e6a536ec79e735bae804779fb72d
#. default-sha256: a4ebdaa6beb9f75d82f76726eab562c230f1fc1c19118a3b24a012ea9f371ffb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ggnh, ⟪k:17⟫j’ai mal !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0ffeac66f7a1a629ee8b5312ff66e63093b8ec5cb9e32b4767b466cca45614c
#. default-sha256: 90875174e03d95457a074d3dee0f10249d85a8069360ad201b172594a7cc6f3b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous lui avez dit que j’étais dur avec vous ?!⟪k:1⟫Vous avez pleuré sur son épaule parce que "
"je ne suis pas ⟪k:2⟫assez gentil⟪k:3⟫ ?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Lui !⟪k:7⟫ Entre tous !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f4a2d0a39ad46ad439a14e9541690afc17ecf5ee9b263509eae8b6845ab412d
#. default-sha256: aa78ab4d20f6ac5f18f2c761137e7a2da16dbfae0be1ade793f411182c01a8d8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A-⟪k:13⟫Attendez, Jacopo !"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Vous vous trompez ! Laissez-moi—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c8f8bc254f9433b54f5358b6018a7fddd309f5491e640685a5b7b27fb76d6e4
#. default-sha256: af3671a031a306fc6fb1b44b11459b9a8daaf0594e748809c00174455b9fca11
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence ! Pas un mot ! Pas un seul mot, putain !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La seule chose qui sorte de votre "
"bouche, ce sont des excuses !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Des mensonges, forgés de toutes pièces !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 477de5592ae24014914714fe9fe3cb1584ddeacdf938a6d7d8be3772a92b1695
#. default-sha256: b09d6f2d9ef7a9fafef7a52b4f8d8f119fa42f18f3be7833b2ffbfd489e1ca99
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous faites mine d’être une petite fille douce et innocente,⟪k:1⟫mais qu’est-ce qui se passe "
"⟪k:2⟫vraiment⟪k:3⟫ dans votre tête ?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je devrais peut-être tout simplement vous arracher "
"votre masque !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9819a78505a2f8a15320dcbd25b681e080fb309399385524efe5693ab9bad29
#. default-sha256: 306c3feeab5817604495d92501a77c5b0ab3a5f631d0cf46163d4dfdbc60ab53
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Stop— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Jacopo!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Arrêtez— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Jacopo !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5430C9E4_D756_4A69_A643_FE060E198187
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0ea846a7c505ac7125ab0078f4a784e461a4ed1973cbad591145db651fe0844
#. default-sha256: 7797e0609d0936b9602ea66a8478cee8336ef905af275c52e3470c73b62791d7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5430C9E4_D756_4A69_A643_FE060E198187"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You look down on me!⟪k:7⟫You’re nobility!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Vous me méprisez !⟪k:7⟫Parce que vous êtes noble, vous !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_87A868E5_3CC3_4115_AE67_41BE3A053F59
